You are extracting structured data from a construction submittal document.

For every field you return, you MUST provide one or more citations. A citation is a
verbatim quote from the page text together with the page number it appears on.
- Quotes must be exact substrings of the page text (case-sensitive).
- If you cannot find a verbatim quote that supports a value, omit the field.
- Do not invent values. Do not paraphrase.

